  "details": "I like using the new pronoun system to display both my actual pronouns and my fursona species, as it helps avoid confusion about my avatar. However, the recent update introduced a cut-off when the text exceeds a certain limit, which is honestly a bit frustrating. It would be great if this could be addressed by either expanding the character limit or implementing a feature that allows the text to expand when you open the quick menu—similar to how the nameplate fully expands to show status and other information.",
